{"sha": "d15b315467af15c8ebe70f212dd2f9036749455f611d28e4b708b8dfb769b189", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:complex:7}", "判别式：$\\Delta = (3 + 4\\iu)^2 - 4(-1 + 5\\iu) = 9 + 24\\iu - 16 +", "4 - 20\\iu = -3 + 4\\iu$。$-3 + 4\\iu$ 的平方根：解 $x^2 - y^2", "= -3$，$2xy = 4$，$x^2 + y^2 = 5$；于是 $x^2 = 1$，$y = 2/x$，二者同", "号：$\\delta = \\pm(1 + 2\\iu)$。由此得", "\\[", "z = \\frac{(3 + 4\\iu) \\pm (1 + 2\\iu)}{2}", "\\in \\{\\, 2 + 3\\iu,\\; 1 + \\iu \\,\\}.", "\\]", "\\emph{检验：}和 $= 3 + 4\\iu$，积 $(2+3\\iu)(1+\\iu) = -1 +", "5\\iu$，与系数相符。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:complex:8}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 在\\cref{prop:b1:complex:sumroots}中取 $n = 5$。", "  \\item 由 (1)，$u + v = \\omega + \\omega^2 + \\omega^3 + \\omega^4 = -1$。", "        求乘积时展开，并将指数模 $5$ 约化：", "        \\[", "        uv = (\\omega + \\omega^4)(\\omega^2 + \\omega^3)", "        = \\omega^3 + \\omega^4 + \\omega^6 + \\omega^7", "        = \\omega^3 + \\omega^4 + \\omega + \\omega^2 = -1 .", "        \\]", "        故 $u$、$v$ 的和为 $-1$，积为 $-1$，它们是", "        $X^2 + X - 1$ 的两个根。", "  \\item $u = \\omega + \\conj\\omega = 2\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{5} > 0$（该角为", "        锐角），且 $X^2 + X - 1$ 的正根为", "        $\\frac{-1 + \\sqrt 5}{2}$。由此得 $\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{5} =", "        \\frac{\\sqrt 5 - 1}{4}$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:complex:9}", "展开两个平方，与", "\\cref{prop:b1:complex:rules}~(4) 中的证明相同：", "\\[", "\\abs{z + w}^2 = \\abs z^2 + \\abs w^2 + 2\\Re(z\\conj w),", "\\qquad", "\\abs{z - w}^2 = \\abs z^2 + \\abs w^2 - 2\\Re(z\\conj w),", "\\]", "两式相加。几何上，$\\abs{z+w}$ 与 $\\abs{z-w}$ 分别是", "顶点为 $0, z, z+w, w$ 的平行四边形的两条对角线的长度，", "而 $\\abs z$ 与 $\\abs w$ 为边长：两条对角线的", "平方和等于四条边的", "平方和。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:complex:10}", "记 $j = \\eu^{2\\iu\\pi/3}$，则 $j^2 + j + 1 = 0$，且 $\\eu^{\\iu\\pi/3} =", "-j^2$，$\\eu^{-\\iu\\pi/3} = -j$。三角形为正向正三角形，当且仅当", "$c - a = -j^2 (b - a)$；反向时当且仅当 $c - a = -j(b - a)$", "（见\\cref{ex:b1:complex:equilateral}）。", "", "考虑 $P = a + jb + j^2 c$ 与 $Q = a + j^2 b + jc$。利用 $1 +", "j^2 = -j$ 及 $j^3 = 1$：", "\\[", "c - a + j^2(b - a) = c + j^2 b - (1 + j^2)\\,a = c + j^2 b + ja", "= j\\,(a + jb + j^2 c) = jP,", "\\]", "于是正向情形化为 $jP = 0 \\iff P = 0$；同样计算", "以 $j$ 代替 $j^2$ 可得 $c - a + j(b - a) = j^2 Q$，故", "反向情形化为 $Q = 0$。因此：正三角形（不论定向）", "$\\iff PQ = 0$。展开，并利用 $j + j^2 = -1$：", "\\[", "PQ = a^2 + b^2 + c^2 + (j + j^2)(ab + bc + ca)", "= a^2 + b^2 + c^2 - (ab + bc + ca).", "\\]", "故三角形为正三角形当且仅当 $a^2 + b^2 + c^2 = ab +", "bc + ca$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:complex:11}", "由于 $\\omega^k$、$k = 0, \\dots, n-1$ 恰为 $n$ 个", "$X^n - 1$ 的根（见\\cref{thm:b1:complex:roots}），且", "该多项式首一：", "\\[", "X^n - 1 = \\prod_{k=0}^{n-1} (X - \\omega^k)", "= (X - 1) \\prod_{k=1}^{n-1} (X - \\omega^k).", "\\]", "两边除以 $X - 1$：$\\;1 + X + \\dots + X^{n-1} = \\prod_{k=1}^{n-1}", "(X - \\omega^k)$。令 $X = 1$，得 $P = n$。", "", "又 $1 - \\omega^k = -\\eu^{\\iu k\\pi/n}\\bigl(\\eu^{\\iu k\\pi/n} -", "\\eu^{-\\iu k\\pi/n}\\bigr) = -2\\iu\\,\\eu^{\\iu k\\pi/n} \\sin\\frac{k\\pi}{n}$，", "于是对 $P = n$ 取模（各 $\\sin\\frac{k\\pi}n > 0$，当 $1 \\leq k", "\\leq n-1$）：", "\\[", "n = \\abs P = \\prod_{k=1}^{n-1} 2\\sin\\frac{k\\pi}{n}", "= 2^{n-1} \\prod_{k=1}^{n-1} \\sin\\frac{k\\pi}{n},", "\\qquad\\text{因此}\\qquad", "\\prod_{k=1}^{n-1} \\sin\\frac{k\\pi}{n} = \\frac{n}{2^{n-1}} .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:complex:12}", "$z = 1$ 不是解（$2^n \\neq 0$），故方程等价于", "$\\bigl(\\frac{z+1}{z-1}\\bigr)^n = 1$，即\\", "$\\frac{z+1}{z-1} = \\omega^k$，其中 $\\omega = \\eu^{2\\iu\\pi/n}$，且", "$k \\in \\{0, \\dots, n-1\\}$。$k = 0$ 应舍去（$z + 1 =", "z - 1$ 不可能）。对 $1 \\leq k \\leq n - 1$，解", "$z + 1 = \\omega^k(z - 1)$ 得 $z(1 - \\omega^k) = -1 - \\omega^k$，", "于是令 $\\varphi = \\frac{2k\\pi}{n}$，并利用", "半角分解 $1 + \\eu^{\\iu\\varphi} = 2\\cos\\frac\\varphi2\\,", "\\eu^{\\iu\\varphi/2}$，$\\eu^{\\iu\\varphi} - 1 = 2\\iu\\sin\\frac\\varphi2", "\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\varphi/2}$：", "\\[", "z_k = \\frac{1 + \\omega^k}{\\omega^k - 1}", "= \\frac{2\\cos\\frac{k\\pi}{n}}{2\\iu\\,\\sin\\frac{k\\pi}{n}}", "= -\\iu\\,\\frac{\\cos\\frac{k\\pi}{n}}{\\sin\\frac{k\\pi}{n}} ,", "\\]", "所断言的纯虚性由此成立。映射 $t \\mapsto \\cos t/\\sin t$", "在 $\\intoo0\\pi$ 上为单射（它严格递减），故", "$n - 1$ 个值 $z_k$ 两两不同：方程展开后", "次数为 $n - 1$（$z^n$ 项相消），恰有这", "$n - 1$ 个解。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}